[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12062.07, "timestamp": "03:21:02", "text": "正在开发中的模型，而且它非常庞大。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12065.99, "timestamp": "03:21:05", "text": "数量，我也想喜欢……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12068.95, "timestamp": "03:21:08", "text": "也可以为此在个人退休账户（IRA）里存钱，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12071.83, "timestamp": "03:21:11", "text": "另外，如果有人愿意提供额外帮助，我还需要其他人的支持。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12074.79, "timestamp": "03:21:14", "text": "看着我，并且愿意点赞备用。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12077.91, "timestamp": "03:21:17", "text": "朝着那个目标稍微……嗯。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12080.63, "timestamp": "03:21:20", "text": "我觉得这对我很有帮助。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12082.469, "timestamp": "03:21:22", "text": "我从这个频道赚到的所有钱，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12085.19, "timestamp": "03:21:25", "text": "一切努力都将用于实现目标。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12087.349, "timestamp": "03:21:27", "text": "这样我就可以在我的 YouTube 模特秀上首次亮相了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12090.07, "timestamp": "03:21:30", "text": "以及所有的一切。是的，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12092.63, "timestamp": "03:21:32", "text": "事件。最初就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12096.469, "timestamp": "03:21:36", "text": "开始了。然后，我……我想喜欢你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12098.63, "timestamp": "03:21:38", "text": "知道才能拥有那份知识"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12100.95, "timestamp": "03:21:40", "text": "模型中会有很多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12103.67, "timestamp": "03:21:43", "text": "人们的期望，呃，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12106.389, "timestamp": "03:21:46", "text": "模型质量等等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12108.71, "timestamp": "03:21:48", "text": "嗯，它太好了，人们会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12112.55, "timestamp": "03:21:52", "text": "某些期望，比如如果我出道的话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12114.95, "timestamp": "03:21:54", "text": "以该模型，我提供的服务很差"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12117.269, "timestamp": "03:21:57", "text": "优质内容，但并不喜欢。"}]